Changelog: 21-11-2026 15:13:54

Release 2.6.0.

Changelog: 21-11-2026 14:06:03

Fixed. The app's text is rewritten to the writing standard: short sentences with one fact each, and lists where a
sentence named three or more parts. This covers the wiki chapter, the README, the tooltips, notes, messages and info
text in the window, the name and password messages of the system part, and the installer's messages. The info text now
ends with a link to the wiki. No label is renamed. Two facts in the wiki chapter are corrected. The chapter said the
small round i repeats the header in short. It says in short what the app does. The chapter also said the header shows
the controller batteries. Its Batteries box shows whether the batteries go to the Bluetooth icon, not their levels.
Nothing the app does has changed. No test changed. The installer's messages that every app shares keep their old wording, and so does "Not authorized: the password
dialog was canceled or refused." (owner, 21-11-2026: those are reworded once, in all installers together).

